<span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Daytime Enemies)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Lore\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Lore</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Facto_Videotape\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Facto Videotape</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-19\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>A new curious factory has emerged in Facto\u2026 and now rumors of a comfy shoe that makes hunting monsters easier are spreading. Can you survive the Crocs mission?\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Map\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Map\">&gt; Moon Map</span></h2>\n<noscript><div role='alert' class='oo-ui-widget oo-ui-widget-enabled oo-ui-labelElement oo-ui-flaggedElement-error oo-ui-iconElement oo-ui-messageWidget-block oo-ui-messageWidget'><span class='oo-ui-iconElement-icon oo-ui-icon-error oo-ui-image-error'></span><span class='oo-ui-labelElement-label'>JavaScript must be enabled for this map to work. If you do not see it below, it probably means you have JavaScript disabled.</span></div><style>.ext-datamaps-container{display:none}</style></noscript><div data-datamap-id=\"1079\" data-mw-datamaps=\"map\" data-mw-datamaps-configure=\"{&quot;id&quot;:1079,&quot;presentationFlags&quot;:0}\" class=\"ext-datamaps-container map-Facto oo-ui-layout oo-ui-panelLayout oo-ui-panelLayout-framed maps\"><div class=\"ext-datamaps-container-top oo-ui-layout oo-ui-panelLayout\"></div><div class=\"ext-datamaps-container-content oo-ui-layout oo-ui-panelLayout\"><div class=\"ext-datamaps-container-leaflet\"><div class=\"ext-datamaps-container-status\"><div role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" id=\"ooui-php-1\" class=\"oo-ui-widget oo-ui-widget-enabled oo-ui-progressBarWidget-indeterminate oo-ui-progressBarWidget\" data-ooui=\"{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;OO.ui.ProgressBarWidget&quot;,&quot;progress&quot;:false}\"><div class=\"oo-ui-progressBarWidget-bar\"></div></div><div>Loading scripts</div></div></div></div><div class=\"ext-datamaps-container-bottom oo-ui-layout oo-ui-panelLayout\"></div><script type=\"application/datamap+json\" data-purpose=\"config\">{\"version\":3635,\"lastPurgeTimestamp\":\"20260804215046\",\"cOrder\":0,\"cRot\":0,\"crs\":[[0,0],[540,960]],\"flags\":521,\"zoom\":{\"lock\":false,\"auto\":true,\"min\":0.05,\"max\":6,\"scrollSpeed\":1},\"backgrounds\":[{\"image\":\"/images/Facto_map.jpg?1b1ba5\"}],\"groups\":{\"Ship\":{\"name\":\"Ship\",\"size\":[100,100],\"markerIcon\":\"/images/thumb/Ship_Icon.png/150px-Ship_Icon.png?1b6048\",\"legendIcon\":\"/images/thumb/Ship_Icon.png/24px-Ship_Icon.png?1b6048\"},\"ShipsPart\":{\"name\":\"Ship's Part\",\"size\":[50,50],\"pinColor\":\"#0094ff\"},\"MainEntrance\":{\"name\":\"Main Entrance\",\"size\":[100,100],\"markerIcon\":\"/images/thumb/Main_entrance.png/150px-Main_entrance.png?6b87de\",\"legendIcon\":\"/images/thumb/Main_entrance.png/24px-Main_entrance.png?6b87de\"},\"FireExits\":{\"name\":\"Fire Exit\",\"size\":[75,75],\"markerIcon\":\"/images/thumb/Fire_exit.png/112px-Fire_exit.png?17c3c4\",\"legendIcon\":\"/images/thumb/Fire_exit.png/24px-Fire_exit.png?17c3c4\"},\"Dropship\":{\"name\":\"Dropship\",\"size\":[75,75],\"markerIcon\":\"/images/thumb/Drop_Ship.png/112px-Drop_Ship.png?e99b10\",\"legendIcon\":\"/images/thumb/Drop_Ship.png/24px-Drop_Ship.png?e99b10\"},\"Rocks\":{\"name\":\"Rocks\",\"size\":40,\"fillColor\":\"#808080\",\"strokeColor\":\"#404040\",\"strokeWidth\":3},\"Plant\":{\"name\":\"Bush\",\"size\":40,\"fillColor\":\"#bf4c00\",\"strokeColor\":\"#722800\",\"strokeWidth\":3},\"DeadTree\":{\"name\":\"Dead tree\",\"size\":40,\"fillColor\":\"#8c5938\",\"strokeColor\":\"#593823\",\"strokeWidth\":3},\"UtilityPole\":{\"name\":\"Utility pole\",\"size\":40,\"fillColor\":\"#7f3300\",\"strokeColor\":\"#e5e5e5\",\"strokeWidth\":3},\"WaterTower\":{\"name\":\"Water tower tank\",\"size\":40,\"fillColor\":\"#c18760\",\"strokeColor\":\"#e5dc97\",\"strokeWidth\":3}},\"layers\":[],\"layerIds\":[]}</script></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Info\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Info\">&gt; Moon Info</span></h2>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\"><b>POPULATION:</b> Abandoned<br /><br /><b>CONDITIONS:</b> Dry. dusty, many industrial artifacts.<br /><br /><b>FAUNA:</b> Dominated by a few Crocs-wearing species.<br /><br />Owned by Crocs(tm)\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Environment\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Environment\">&gt; Environment</span></h2>\n<p>Facto is an abandoned industrial moon featuring rough landscape, dead soil, several bushes, dead trees, lying rocks, telecommunications poles and factory buildings that contain Crocs shoes. Upon exiting the ship, to right and left will be telecommunications poles and especially large one to the left. When you go left those poles will lead you close to one of the fire exits. Leading straight out of the ship and going behind that one little hill in front of the ship will lead you close enough to the main entrance to spot it. To access the second and last fire exit on this moon, you need to go a little bit right from that small hill and then you should be able to find it.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Weather\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Weather\">&gt; Weather</span></h2>\n<p><b>Facto</b> supports Rainy, Foggy, Stormy, Eclipsed, Earthquake, Forsaken, Hallowed, and Hurricane weather by default.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unique_Scrap\">Unique Scrap</span></h3>\n<p>On this moon you can find unique scrap such as <b>crocs shoes</b>. For example: gold croc, glitter croc, box of crocs, time croc, etc. Vanilla scrap can also be found, like: egg beater, cookie mold pan, V-type engine, etc.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Crocs_Enemies\">Crocs Enemies</span></h3>\n<p>Except finding <b>crocs shoes</b>, you can also encounter <b>enemies wearing those</b>. Entities like earth leviathan or hygrodere do not have them for obvious reasons. All enemies on this moon are the same as Vanilla ones. Crocs shoes on their feet are just a cosmetic addition.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Progression\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Progression\">&gt; Progression</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocked_By\">Unlocked By</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Inserting <b>Facto videotape</b> to videotape player on Galetry. This <b>videotape</b> that can be found on <a href=\"/wiki/Polarus\" title=\"Polarus\">Polarus</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Filitrios\" title=\"Filitrios\">Filitrios</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Empra\" title=\"Empra\">Empra</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Trite\" title=\"Trite\">Trite</a> and in Gift Shop on <a href=\"/wiki/Galetry\" title=\"Galetry\">Galetry</a>.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocks\">Unlocks</span></h3>\n<p>This moon does not unlock any other moon.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Loot_Table\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Loot_Table\">&gt; Loot Table</span></h2>\n<p><b>NOTE:</b> Maneater plushie, Silent package and Webley will be able to spawn only if you downloaded Wesley's Moons.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Scrap Items\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Scrap Name</th>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Conductive</th>\n<th>Weight (lbs)</th>\n<th>Min Value</th>\n<th>Avg Value</th>\n<th>Max Value</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Large axle</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Large_axle.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Large axle.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Large_axle.png/60px-Large_axle.png?6b5c59\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Large_axle.png/90px-Large_axle.png?6b5c59 1.5x, /images/thumb/Large_axle.png/120px-Large_axle.png?6b5c59 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>36</td>\n<td>46</td>\n<td>56</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>1.78%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V-type engine</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:V-type_engine.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"V-type engine.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/V-type_engine.png/60px-V-type_engine.png?801274\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/V-type_engine.png/90px-V-type_engine.png?801274 1.5x, /images/thumb/V-type_engine.png/120px-V-type_engine.png?801274 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>38</td>\n<td>56</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>1.78%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plastic fish</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Plastic_fish.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Plastic fish.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Plastic_fish.png/60px-Plastic_fish.png?6b9b22\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Plastic_fish.png/90px-Plastic_f