/td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4.81%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Lore\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Lore\">&gt; Lore</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Facto_Videotape\">Facto Videotape</span></h3>\n<p>This videotape can found on <span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/Trite\" title=\"Trite\">Trite</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Polarus\" title=\"Polarus\">Polarus</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Empra\" title=\"Empra\">Empra</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Filitrios\" title=\"Filitrios\">Filitrios</a> and in Gift Shop on <a href=\"/wiki/Galetry\" title=\"Galetry\">Galetry</a>.</span></span>\n</p><p><video poster=\"/images/thumb/FactoTapeVideo.mp4/500px--FactoTapeVideo.mp4.jpg?b4b1f1\" controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" class=\"thumbborder\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" data-durationhint=\"43\" data-mwtitle=\"FactoTapeVideo.mp4\" data-mwprovider=\"local\" style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:100%;height:100%\"><source src=\"/images/FactoTapeVideo.mp4?b4b1f1\" type=\"video/mp4; codecs=&quot;avc1.42E01E, mp4a.40.2&quot;\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" /></video>\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Text <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">You are the sole of the foot that supports this society. Corporate greed is stepping out of its bounds. I need you to step in, to...<br /><br />...to wear these fantastic new shoes! From Facto! Yes, you heard that right. Facto is now manufacturing these fantastic new shoes. Wow! They are so comfy and stylish you'll never want to leave! Come to Facto and we will let you out!\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Trivia\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Trivia\">&gt; Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This moon was commisioned by <b>Crocs</b>.</li>\n<li>Most enemies are wearing crocs shoes.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:41px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Facto_Main_Entrance.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"Facto&#39;s main entrance\"><img alt=\"Facto&#39;s main entrance\" src=\"/images/thumb/Facto_Main_Entrance.jpg/120px-Facto_Main_Entrance.jpg?1fa6a3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Facto_Main_Entrance.jpg/180px-Facto_Main_Entrance.jpg?1fa6a3 1.5x, /images/thumb/Facto_Main_Entrance.jpg/240px-Facto_Main_Entrance.jpg?1fa6a3 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><center>Facto's main entrance</center></div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:41px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Facto_Fire_Exit_1.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"Facto&#39;s fire exit\"><img alt=\"Facto&#39;s fire exit\" src=\"/images/thumb/Facto_Fire_Exit_1.jpg/120px-Facto_Fire_Exit_1.jpg?398420\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Facto_Fire_Exit_1.jpg/180px-Facto_Fire_Exit_1.jpg?398420 1.5x, /images/thumb/Facto_Fire_Exit_1.jpg/240px-Facto_Fire_Exit_1.jpg?398420 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><center>Facto's fire exit</center></div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<d